WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.383 --> 00:00:03.617
Unit eight. Social Determinants of Health!

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.689
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:13.575
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:18.033
Today we learn about Social Determinants of Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:23.621
Social determinants. Say it with me. Social determinants!

6
00:00:27.091 --> 00:00:30.691
Income. Say it with me. Income!

7
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.594
Education. Say it with me. Education!

8
00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:45.695
Housing. Say it with me. Housing!

9
00:00:49.203 --> 00:00:53.303
Employment. Say it with me. Employment!

10
00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:00.943
Environment. Say it with me. Environment!

11
00:01:04.484 --> 00:01:08.834
Inequality. Say it with me. Inequality!

12
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:16.940
Health outcomes. Say it with me. Health outcomes!

13
00:01:20.436 --> 00:01:32.812
Social determinants of health — income, education, housing, employment, and environment — strongly shape health outcomes. Reducing inequality improves population health.

14
00:01:32.862 --> 00:01:36.333
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:37.071 --> 00:01:42.385
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.585
Education!

17
00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:49.990
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.229
Inequality!

19
00:01:52.377 --> 00:01:58.490
Did you know? Where people live, learn and work can affect their health as much as medical care does!

20
00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.637
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:09.811
Think and answer. How can education affect health?

22
00:02:09.861 --> 00:02:11.029
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:17.364
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.414 --> 00:02:20.188
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

